{"id":72151,"date":"2026-10-31T22:30:28","date_gmt":"2026-10-31T22:30:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72151"},"modified":"2026-10-31T23:32:13","modified_gmt":"2026-10-31T22:32:13","slug":"sao-silvestre-vila-madeiro","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-vila-madeiro\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre Vila Madeiro 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre Vila Madeiro 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre Vila Madeiro 2026<\/strong> realiza-se na noite de quarta-feira, <strong>23 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partidas e chegadas centradas no <strong>Jardim da Rep\u00fablica \/ Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica<\/strong>, no cora\u00e7\u00e3o hist\u00f3rico de <strong>Penamacor<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Castelo Branco<\/strong>. A estreia desta prova noturna decorre na data mais emblem\u00e1tica do concelho \u2014 a noite em que milhares de visitantes se re\u00fanem para o tradicional acender do <strong>Maior Madeiro de Portugal<\/strong> \u00e0 meia-noite, logo ap\u00f3s a cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa competitivo arranca \u00e0s <strong>19:30<\/strong> com a <strong>Labaredas One Mile (1609 metros)<\/strong> destinada aos escal\u00f5es de Infantis, Iniciados e Juvenis (nascidos entre 2009 e 2014), seguida \u00e0s <strong>19:45<\/strong> pela <strong>Fagulhas Run de 400 metros<\/strong> para a Pequenada e Benjamins A\/B (nascidos a partir de 2015). \u00c0s <strong>20:15<\/strong> \u00e9 dado o tiro de partida para a prova rainha, a <strong>Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre \"Vila Madeiro\" de 8,6 km (8600 metros)<\/strong> para Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos I, II e III, contando com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip no dorsal e posto de abastecimento interm\u00e9dio.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada conjuntamente pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Penamacor<\/strong> e pela <strong>PTN \u2013 Eventos Desportivos<\/strong>, com a colabora\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>ADEP \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Penamacorense<\/strong> e do <strong>Agrupamento de Escolas Ribeiro Sanches<\/strong>, a iniciativa assume um forte cariz solid\u00e1rio: parte do valor das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es reverte para a aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o de material desportivo a doar a uma institui\u00e7\u00e3o de apoio a crian\u00e7as do concelho. Os residentes em Penamacor usufruem de <strong>50% de desconto<\/strong> e os atletas alojados em hot\u00e9is ou alojamentos locais do concelho beneficiam de <strong>25% de desconto<\/strong> na prova principal. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">23 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Penamacor, Castelo Branco<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; backgro